Keep the shared core, evidence, bundle, group row and outcome widths in (`rule:nrz:matrix-loans-kernel-family-resources`) unchanged for every unary control. Use a closed alternative in the existing optional endpoint-token storage: Absent, the existing prepared endpoint-token pair, or the binary side-owner box. Its largest payload remains the existing 48-byte pair with the same aligned discriminant; it is not an added universal field. Prepared endpoints and a binary side owner are mutually exclusive and must be checked at every authentication boundary. The existing 23-entry largest cancellation alternative accommodates an 18-entry binary alternative without widening the group table. The one-cell extent owner grows from one 24-byte `Extent` to two, while remaining one shared allocation and one debit. A binary domain variant must not enlarge `KernelError` or `CellOutcome`. Independent layout mirrors must demonstrate each of these premises; if they cannot, the shared representation is an open prerequisite, not permission to revise unary pins or introduce another application mechanism.

On the established 64-bit ABI the binary side-owner size is X=1592 bytes: the original checked correspondence contains one `CheckedOperation`, two `BindingSymbols`, two full source identities, one destination `BindingSymbols` and one `CellAxis`; its captured right source adds one `Declaration`, one `Identity`, three optional `QualifiedMaskVersion` attachments, one optional format-erased pin record and one `Token`. The original correspondence is `64+2*24+2*216+24+24=592` bytes; the right capture is `80+216+3*224=968` bytes; the optional pin and token add `8+24=32` bytes. Thus `X=592+968+32=1592`, with eight-byte alignment and no shared counters. The 224-byte optional qualified attachment retains the format/channel niche, and the optional pin is one eight-byte pointer. These are field inventories to reproduce through independent ABI mirrors, not an instruction to use a compiler size report as an acceptance oracle. These fields independently pair original and captured witnesses, so eliminating them merely because descriptors coincide is not an optimization. The right numerical pin was already funded by its creator. Its release is not charged again. The extra copied symbolic handles are prepaid below. No per-cell vector or additional native mask is needed.

